OL,3,ARestriction zone scheme for offenders
OL,4,Ato start in October
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme that could see serious sexual
OL,7,Fand violent offenders confined to areas
OL,8,Fjust a few miles wide after leaving
OL,9,Fprison will be launched in October,
OL,10,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris has
OL,11,Fannounced.
OL,13,FGovernment ministers say this is
OL,14,Fdesigned to give victims greater
OL,15,Ffreedom and further reduce the
OL,16,Fpossibility of unwanted contact
OL,18,FThe intention to introduce "restriction
OL,19,Fzones" for violent offenders who leave
OL,20,Fprison and who are on probation was
OL,21,Ffirst announced by the government last
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
