OL,3,ARestriction zone scheme for offenders
OL,4,Ato start in October
OL,5,
OL,6,FProbation officers will be able to
OL,7,Flimit where serious offenders can go
OL,8,Ffor as long as it is deemed necessary.
OL,9,FThose who breach their new boundaries
OL,10,Fcould be recalled to prison.
